      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In meantime I found a workaround for this issue. I have to get the head position/rotation at OnWillRenderObject or OnPreCull instead at Update/LateUpdate or PostLateUpdate.\n\nBut it's still unclear what exactly changed. Has Unity 2022 a new behavior regarding updating VR cameras or changed something in PlayerApi.GetTrackingData()?\n\nIt would be nice if the tracking data would not be behind a frame - at least not for the PostLateUpdate event.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
